    "description": "<p>UNLIVING-GHOST</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 4</p>\n<p>Your strikes pass through armour and flesh to scrape directly across the animating spirit.</p>\n<p>When you make an unarmed attack or natural attack, you may have the attack deal essence damage instead of its normal physical damage type. The attack remains magical.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: an unarmed or natural attack asks before the roll whether to deal essence instead (as Versatile does); an essence strike counts as magical.</p>",
